\hline
block size & 20      & 30      & 40      & 50      & 55      & 60      & 65      & 70 \\ \hline
$\delta$   & 1.01168 & 1.01135 & 1.01119 & 1.01098 & 1.01007 & 1.00987 & 1.00934 & 1.00902 \\ \hline
